    "summary": "Your LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH units each have the ability Seductive Gambit: after such a unit completes a Charge move, its player may announce a Seductive Gambit for it. If you do, it loses Fights First for the rest of the turn, and in exchange its models may re-roll Hit rolls and re-roll Wound rolls of 1 for their attacks for the rest of that turn.",
